==Description==
'''v1.7.5''' is the fifty-fifth update to be released on Tower Defense Simulator, on the 26th of May 2023. It introduced multiple nametags and charms.

Oddly, the update version for this update is ''v1.7.5'', despite there being no ''v1.7.4 update.

This version encompassed two updates, the main v1.7.5 Update (released 26 May 2023) and the minor v1.7.5a Update (released 27 May 2023).

==Additions==
*Dynamic inventory scaling
*[[Nametags]] inventory
*[[Charms]] inventory
*[[Follower Nametag]]
*[[GraveDigger Nametag]]
*[[Molten Nametag]]
*[[Fallen Nametag]]
*[[Polluted Nametag]]
*[[GunSlinger Nametag]]
*[[Grave Digger Charm]]
*[[Molten Boss Charm]]
*[[Fallen King Charm]]
*[[Nuclear Monster Charm]]
*[[Gunslinger Charm]]
*New [[Codes|Code]]: NAMETAGSRCOOL
**Gives the [[Follower Nametag]].

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*Emote preview in the daily emote store now uses your avatar instead of the noob with pale skin, green torso and blue legs.
*[[Military Base]]'s spawnrate timer no longer resets when it is upgraded to a Level that spawns a different unit.
*Fixed [[DJ Booth]] having a slightly bigger range at Level 5.

:In '''v1.7.5a''':
*Changed '''v1.7.5''' in-game update log banner from a clean version of the [[Cold Front Crate]] thumbnail to a clean version of the [[Ducky Crate]] thumbnail.
*Fixed [[Fallen King (Legacy)|Fallen King]] not spawning at the final wave.

